{"author":{"id":"973fc03426eba9a243913e0f6e6823e102397744f60a9ab11c882af948c310c4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1778894061,"nonce":"PBp6mxk+34Z485YrVDscFGxk/y4=","title":"Auth auto-approve lease with delegated YubiKey-wrapped signing key","message":"## Problem\\nMandible auth approvals currently require a manual dashboard approval and the protected-branch merge uses the user's default YubiKey-backed SSH signing key, which can require a touch for each merge signature. The desired workflow is a temporary auth-auto-approve lease: the user authenticates once, then Mandible can automatically approve incoming auth requests for a bounded duration.\\n\\n## Design constraints\\n- Default behavior remains unchanged: when the lease is off, auth merges use the user's configured SK/YubiKey signing key.\\n- The lease is off on every Mandible restart and machine restart. Only duration/configuration persists.\\n- Turning the lease on requires user authentication. Turning it off does not.\\n- Lease signing uses a separate user-owned delegated signing key, not the agent key and not a key bundled with Mandible.\\n- Mandible must provide setup/onboarding for associating a user's delegated key material with Mandible. The durable private key artifact must be encrypted from creation; the public key is shown for GitHub registration.\\n- The delegated key unlock should be YubiKey-wrapped, using age-plugin-yubikey when available.\\n- During an active lease, Mandible should expose the delegated key only through a scoped ssh-agent with an expiry, and auth execution should receive only scoped signing config/environment.\\n- The audit trail should make lease-based approvals distinguishable from live manual approvals.\\n\\n## Implementation notes\\nUse age-plugin-yubikey for wrapping the delegated key passphrase/secret. Store only configuration and encrypted artifacts under a user data directory. Provide status/setup endpoints and UI affordances in Auth and Settings.\\n\\n---\\nCo-Authored-By: Codex (GPT-5) \u003ccodex@openai.com\u003e","files":null}]}